# The build is authored on Windows (core.autocrlf=true) and verified on Linux
# CI, where `git diff --exit-code` compares the regenerated files against the
# committed ones. Without a normalised line ending every generated file reads
# as wholly rewritten and the drift check fails on a clean tree.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.woff2 binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
